{"text": " Ak bude\u0161 tv\u00ed\u010di\u0165 s trh\u00e1\u010dkami, bude\u0161 ma\u0165 mal\u00e9 predlaktie. Toto typov\u00fd iba niekdo kdo vy o\u010di\u010den\u00ed asi to\u013eko ako ja o \u0161trikovanie. To, \u017ee s\u00fa trh\u00e1\u010dky absoluto nutnos\u0165ou pri cv\u00edkoch ako s\u00fa ar-dielka, z\u0165ahovanie klatky pritahy, o tom sa ani bavidne mus\u00edm. Voj \u00fachopti zliha o mnogo r\u00fdchlej\u0161ie ako cielove svali na t\u00fdchto cv\u00edkoch a teraz t\u00fdch cv\u00edkov nev\u00fd\u0165a\u017ei\u0161 ani z \u010fal\u00e9ka maximu. A argument je typu, \u017ee ty nepov\u017eeva\u0161 trh\u00e1\u010dky lebo si chlap ja n\u00e1vrhujem z\u00e1hodi\u0165 svoje ego, za\u010daj je rozm\u00fd\u0161\u013ea\u0165, za\u010da\u0165 svi\u010di\u0165 s rozumom a teda je efekt\u00edvnej\u0161ie, \u010fak\u00e1 \u010demu bude\u0161 ma\u0165 lep\u0161ie vysledky, \u010fak\u00e1 \u010demu bude\u0161 je v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ich klat. V\u00e1lek predlaktiam, ja pou\u017e\u00edvam trh\u00e1\u010dky na ka\u017edom, tiahovam cv\u00edku u\u017e minim\u00e1lne 5 rokov a predlaktia pova\u017eujem za jednu z mojich najsonnej\u0161\u00edch part\u00ed. Ale \u00e1no, to, \u017ee m\u00e1m ja dobr\u00e9 predlaktia, neznamen\u00e1 autom\u00e1cik, \u017ee bude\u0161 aj t\u00fdch, ka\u017ed\u00fd m\u00e1me predispoz\u00edcije na in\u00e9 veci. Ako sa ale d\u00e1ma\u0165 navite predlaktia, ke\u010f pou\u017e\u00edma\u0161 trh\u00e1\u010dky? No tak, \u017ee sv\u00e1li predlaktia s\u00fa rovnak\u00e9, ako ka\u017ede in\u00e9, daj\u00fa sa priamo cvi\u010di\u0165 a tak\u00e9to priame cvi\u010de nebude obnoho efekt\u00edvnej\u0161ie a kemy sa ich sna\u017e\u00ed odv\u00ed\u010di\u0165 t\u00fdm, \u017ee nebuje\u0161 trh\u00e1\u010dky pou\u017e\u00edva\u0165. Uplne ti na to sta\u010da dva cv\u00edky, na vn\u00fatornostran predlakt\u00ed nejak\u00e1 forma, flexie, z\u00e1pesti ako vid\u00ed\u0161, tu je jedno ako formou a na brachy o radi\u00e1lis, \u010do je ta najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161ia gu\u010da na t\u00fdch predlaktiach, tak\u00e9to z dvihi nad matom alebo hammer curls tak tie\u017e nezale\u017e\u00ed ako formou, \u010di u\u017e nakl\u00e1dke z jedn\u00fa ru\u010dkami alebo ako. Pokia\u013e ma\u0161 la dobre predlaktie na predlaktia, ako m\u00e1m je tak tieto cv\u00edky, ani ve\u013emi nepotrebuje svi\u010di tak, ako tieto sv\u00e1li s\u00fa ve\u013emi intenz\u00edvne zapojen\u00e9 pri klasick\u00fdch bicepsov\u00fdch zlyhoch alebo nejak\u00fdch in\u00fdch bicepsov\u00fdch cviko, ktor\u00e9 som si ist\u00fd, \u017ee ur\u010dite u\u017e cvi\u010di\u0161. Tak\u017ee sa sna\u017ei\u0165 cvi\u010di s rozumom, \u010co m\u00f4\u017ee\u0161 ma\u0165 o mnoho lep\u0161ie vysledky a pre viac je do du\u0161en\u00fdch r\u00e1d ako optym\u00e1zova\u0165 svoj\u00ed treningy. Ho\u010f po\u013eo.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.2, "text": " Ak bude\u0161 tv\u00ed\u010di\u0165 s trh\u00e1\u010dkami, bude\u0161 ma\u0165 mal\u00e9 predlaktie.", "tokens": [50364, 9629, 272, 2303, 7891, 256, 85, 870, 10236, 72, 27101, 262, 504, 71, 842, 10236, 48737, 11, 272, 2303, 7891, 463, 27101, 2806, 526, 3852, 75, 5886, 414, 13, 50524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3696985541449653, "compression_ratio": 1.4984709480122325, "no_speech_prob": 0.04218606650829315}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.2, "end": 6.8, "text": " Toto typov\u00fd iba niekdo kdo vy o\u010di\u010den\u00ed asi to\u013eko ako ja o \u0161trikovanie.", "tokens": [50524, 314, 6738, 2125, 5179, 11822, 33423, 2838, 74, 2595, 350, 2595, 44766, 277, 10236, 72, 10236, 268, 870, 28644, 281, 46634, 4093, 43567, 2784, 277, 22552, 83, 470, 33516, 7155, 13, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3696985541449653, "compression_ratio": 1.4984709480122325, "no_speech_prob": 0.04218606650829315}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.8, "end": 10.200000000000001, "text": " To, \u017ee s\u00fa trh\u00e1\u010dky absoluto nutnos\u0165ou pri cv\u00edkoch ako s\u00fa ar-dielka,", "tokens"